<title>FRANCE: Union Miniere unit raises zinc price.</title>
<headline>Union Miniere unit raises zinc price.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Miniere SA subsidiary Union Miniere France on Wednesday raised its indicative zinc price to 9,950 francs per tonne.</p>
<p>The last change was to 9,500 francs on July 2.</p>
<p>The action was in line with zinc market developments, the statement said.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
